#==============================================================================================
#
#   tests_itoa_2 - Expected itoa results pinned from the C dtoa.c
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Generated by a C driver compiled against upstream QuickJS dtoa.c (2026-06-04): each
#       line is one call and the exact bytes (or bits) C produced. Do not edit by hand.
#
#==============================================================================================

